    "description": "You are purchasing a \"Vintage Glass Insulators Assorted Lot w/Aqua & Clear Hemingray\" in \"Used\" condition.\nNice little starter lot for a glass insulator collection or a perfect bundle for upcycling and decor projects. This set includes eight original vintage glass insulators in mixed clear and aqua tones, offering a great variety of shapes and profiles for display. Three taller aqua insulators feature classic dome and skirt forms, full of character with subtle bubbles and swirl in the glass. Five clear insulators range from chunky to more streamlined profiles, ideal for rustic farmhouse decor, industrial shelf styling, or creative repurposing as candle holders or small planters. They display well together as a group and would look great on a window sill, mantle, or in a collection. Each piece has aged charm and the authentic wear you expect from original utility glass. Includes: - 3 aqua glass insulators (various heights and shapes) - 5 clear glass insulators (various heights and shapes). Perfect for collectors, vintage enthusiasts, photographers, or crafters looking for unique glass accents.\nKeywords: vintage glass insulators, clear glass insulator, aqua glass insulator, telegraph insulators, utility glass, rustic farmhouse decor, industrial decor, repurposed glass, vintage lot, collectible glass, mixed insulator set\nSet of eight vintage glass insulators in assorted clear and aqua colors with visible signs of age and use. Surfaces show light scratches, scuffs, and dirt in recessed areas. The smallest aqua insulator has some chips on the base. Overall structurally solid with no large cracks observed.\nCondition Notes:\nSet of eight vintage glass insulators in assorted clear and aqua colors with visible signs of age and use. Surfaces show light scratches, scuffs, and dirt in recessed areas. The smallest aqua insulator has some chips on the base. Overall structurally solid with no large cracks observed.\nAspects:\nItem Weight: 10 lbs\nCountry of Origin: United States",
